      "text": "Cloud Bigtable with multi-cluster routing and Google Bare Metal Solution for the on-premises footprint",
      "explanation": "This joins a wide column NoSQL service capable of multi cluster routing with a dedicated bare metal platform in Google Cloud for specialized workloads.",
      "correct": false,
